# Project Rules

## Project Shape
- This project is configured for dotnet-forge with six Codex-backed agents: specifier, coder, cleaner, architect, hardener, and QA.
- Project language: Babashka.

## Local Configuration
- Preserve project-local dotnet-forge configuration under `dotnet-forge/`.
- Keep swarm state local under `.dotnet-forge/`, worktrees under `.worktrees/`, and shared scripts under `dotnet-forge/scripts/`.

## Handoffs
- Prefer terse, explicit handoffs that report state and request role-appropriate review. Do not include verifications or sender process narrative.

## Ownership
- Do not change another role's prompt or workflow ownership without explicit user direction.
